Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.21,0:01:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,TUCO:\NHa-ha-ha.\NWhat is this? It's blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.01,0:01:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT:\NWe used a different chemical\Nprocess, but it is every bit as pure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.43,0:01:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It may be blue,\Nbut it' s the bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.77,0:02:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,[SNIFFS]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.98,0:02:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Argh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.15,0:02:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Tight, tight, tight. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.61,0:02:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue, yellow, pink,\Nwhatever, man,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.78,0:02:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,just keep\Nbringing me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.96,0:02:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You' re all right. We' re gonna make\Na lot of money together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.29,0:02:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Just remember\Nwho you're working for.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.97,0:02:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.93,0:02:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just saying, they\Ngotta know that they're\Nworking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.30,0:02:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,TUCO:\NLike they don't already know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.43,0:02:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying\Nthat they're stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.19,0:02:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm just saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.98,0:02:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, so you're not saying\Nthat they're stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.82,0:02:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So l don' t understand.\NAre you saying that l'm stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.61,0:02:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.24,0:02:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that what\Nyou' re doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.45,0:02:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT:\NTuco. Tuco.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.04,0:03:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why don't we all\Njust relax, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.50,0:03:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,[LAUGHING]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.09,0:03:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Heisenberg says relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.01,0:03:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm relaxed.\NI'm relaxed. l'm rela--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.19,0:03:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.53,0:03:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, man! Look at that!\NLook! Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.36,0:03:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.87,0:03:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Heisenberg. Next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.71,0:03:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,[LAUGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.62,0:04:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[BREATHING HEAVlLY]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.22,0:04:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Adjusting for inflation
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.59,0:04:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Good state college,\Nadjusting for inflation,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.51,0:04:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,say, $45,000 a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.22,0:04:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Two kids, four years of college,\N$360,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.44,0:04:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Remaining mortgage\Non the home, 1 07,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.61,0:05:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Home equity line, 30,000.\NThat's 1 37,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.95,0:05:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Cost of living, food,\Nclothing, utilities,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.62,0:05:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,say, 2 grand a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.20,0:05:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, that should put\Na dent in it, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.96,0:05:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty-four K a year,\Nprovide for, say, 1 0 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.96,0:05:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's $240,000.\NPlus 360, plus 1 37.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.30,0:05:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Seven thirty-seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.97,0:05:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Seven hundred and thirty-seven\Nthousand. That's what l need.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.81,0:05:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That is what I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.11,0:05:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I both clear\Nabout 70 grand a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.07,0:05:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's only 1 0 and half more\Nweeks. Call it 1 1 .
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.11,0:05:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Eleven more drug deals, and always\Nin a public place from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.45,0:05:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's doable. Definitely doable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.85,0:06:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,JESSE: Whoa.\NNo, no. Stop, stop, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.62,0:06:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[NO-DOZE GRUNTlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.04,0:06:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Heisenberg!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.13,0:06:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?\NWhat's wrong with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.93,0:06:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,TUCO:\NWhat's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.43,0:06:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't take\Nan ass-beating, bitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.97,0:06:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn, Tuco.\NShut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.10,0:06:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no, uh, pulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.35,0:06:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Do something.\NDo something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.02,0:07:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He needs an ambulance.\NHe needs a hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.57,0:07:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Do something!\NYou' re smart, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.15,0:07:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Do that-- Do that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.24,0:07:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT:\NNo, there's not--\NThere's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.24,0:07:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,TUCO:\NBreathe into his mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.83,0:07:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No, they don't teach that\Nanymore. lt doesn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.33,0:07:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You, come here.\NBreathe into his mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.09,0:07:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.78,0:07:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,[TUCO GRUNTING]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.71,0:07:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,TUCO:\NGet rid of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.25,0:08:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Tuco,\Nwe can' t do him like that, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.59,0:08:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Buzzards and rats and all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.63,0:08:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just saying, you know?\NIt's not very Christian.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.14,0:08:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds like arguing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.71,0:08:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[CLANKING]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.01,0:08:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,[TUCO WHISTLES]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.34,0:08:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,TUCO:\NGonzo, hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.24,0:09:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the big hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.16,0:09:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, l-- I just think\Nwe're done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.46,0:09:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.89,0:09:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You' re done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.22,0:10:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,[DOOR OPENS & CLOSES]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.06,0:11:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,SAMMY:\NHey, I'm back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.77,0:11:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.91,0:11:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN [ON TV]:\NAre already married--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.29,0:11:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.92,0:11:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,[INDlSTlNCT DIALOGUE ON TV]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.84,0:11:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,WOMAN [ON TV]:\NThank you to our νiewers--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.00,0:11:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,SKYLER:\NHey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.51,0:11:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN:\NThe crash happened\Nas rush hour began around 8 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.22,0:11:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.14,0:11:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.19,0:11:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.44,0:11:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.\NHey yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.07,0:12:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you can' t answer\Nwhen l'm calling you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.29,0:12:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.87,0:12:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.96,0:12:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,New hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.55,0:12:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.30,0:12:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,[SIGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.47,0:12:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I got some grilled chicken\Nat Albertson's.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.35,0:12:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to heat\Nsome up for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.39,0:12:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,WOMAN:\NBut they can occasionally adapt\Nto other local areas
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.48,0:12:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,like airports, golf courses--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.02,0:12:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[TV TURNS OFF]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.08,0:12:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Where've you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.94,0:13:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[WALT SOBBlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.49,0:13:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,SKYLER:\NWhat is--?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.29,0:13:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.79,0:13:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.62,0:13:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what?\NI've got all this crap\Non my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.04,0:13:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me clean up first,\Nokay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.25,0:13:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Walter Junior's\Ngonna be home any minute, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.47,0:13:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Um-- Yeah, just...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.59,0:13:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Hold-- Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.14,0:13:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up. Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.56,0:13:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.48,0:14:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,[SIGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.28,0:14:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're scared
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.32,0:14:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and you're angry and you're frustrated.\NAnd l know none of this is fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.00,0:14:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But you cannot take it out on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.38,0:15:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT JR.:\NHey, I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.82,0:15:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.38,0:16:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,JESSE:\NOh, we are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.96,0:16:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Dead, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.26,0:16:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Ruto or rute\Nor however the hell you--
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.05,0:16:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,This is conjecture.\NThis is conjecture?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.10,0:16:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. And conjecture isn' t helping.\NConjecture--?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.22,0:16:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to state the facts.\NOkay, fine. Facts, then. Fact A:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.81,0:16:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,My phone rang eight times\Nlast night. Dead air,\Nhang ups every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.15,0:16:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Second fact:\NLike 3 in the morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.06,0:16:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw that black Caddy of his\Ncruising my neighborhood.\NNo headlights.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.65,0:16:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If he wanted to kill us,\Nhe would've\Ndone it at the junkyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.28,0:16:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that, conjecture?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.03,0:16:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you basing that on\Nthat he's got, like, a normal,\Nhealthy brain or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.87,0:16:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you not see him beat a dude\Nto death for, like, nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.50,0:17:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And that way-- That way\Nhe just kept staring at us,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.54,0:17:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,saying, "You' re done."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.34,0:17:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,"You're done"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.55,0:17:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what that means?\NI will tell you what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.38,0:17:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That means\Nexactly how it sounds, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.51,0:17:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. We are witnesses.\NWe are loose ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.26,0:17:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, Tuco's thinking,\N"Yeah, hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.68,0:17:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,they cook good meth,\Nbut can l trust them?"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.27,0:17:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What happens\Nwhen he decides "no"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.70,0:17:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.87,0:17:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It is him or us. You understand?\NIt is him or us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.38,0:17:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How would you do it?\NWhat do you mean, how would l do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.01,0:17:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Specifically,\Nhow would you do it?\NStep by step.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.77,0:18:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.94,0:18:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Say we set up\None last sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.94,0:18:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This is providing\Nhe doesn't decide\Nto waste us before then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.36,0:18:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time we bring in\Na new batch, he always\Ntests the product, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.78,0:18:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So as his head is down,\Nyou know, giving it a snort, just:\NPop, pop, pop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.49,0:18:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Pop, pop, pop.\NSo three shots?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.83,0:18:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Three shots or, l don' t know, two.\NNo, wait. ls it two, or is it three?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.29,0:18:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Two would probably work, l guess.\NOkay, two shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.88,0:18:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Two in the chest? Two in the face?\NMan, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.55,0:18:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just trying to understand\Nhow this works.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.76,0:18:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. All right,\Nwe'll put a pin in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.05,0:18:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But by now,\Nthe big guy, Gonzo,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.31,0:18:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,he's probably coming at you, right?\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.60,0:18:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. So you turn toward him.\NYeah, just wheel on him--
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.94,0:18:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How many shots for him?\NI mean, he's a big guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.98,0:18:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How many shots\Ndoes that take?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.56,0:18:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know. Three shots.\NOkay, three shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.61,0:18:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Tuco and Gonzo.\NTwo men down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.57,0:18:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, is there\Nanyone else there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.45,0:18:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, Tuco is usually\Nwith someone else, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.78,0:19:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe even a couple of guys.\NHis dealers, his posse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.25,0:19:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.25,0:19:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll put a pin\Nin that one too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.71,0:19:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now at this point, how many\Nshots have been fired?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.88,0:19:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you've gotta be running\Nlow, right? How many bullets\Ndoes that gun even take?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.64,0:19:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.89,0:19:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.14,0:19:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[GRUNTlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.44,0:19:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you suggest\Nthat we kill a man
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.61,0:19:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,and you can' t even\Nopen the gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.12,0:19:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that easy, is it?\NHey, man, Walt, you did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.79,0:19:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.64,0:20:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.52,0:20:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,MARIE:\NCall Skyler.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.85,0:20:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,[PHONE BEEPING]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.23,0:20:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,[PHONE RINGING]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.40,0:20:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,SKYLER [ON RECORDING]:\NHey, there. You' ve reached Walt,\NSkyler and Walter, Jr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.61,0:20:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't come to the phone right now,\Nso please leave us a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.33,0:20:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, aren't you early bird,\Nup and out already?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.91,0:20:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, the big lug and I\Nare gonna go try\Nthat new restaurant
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.71,0:20:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,over by UNM tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.37,0:20:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,so let me know\Nif you guys wanna hang.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.09,0:20:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me. "Hang."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.38,0:20:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt Jr. will be proud.\NI know the lingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.88,0:20:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still hip.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.22,0:20:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Chinese. The restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.97,0:20:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know,\NI just feel like Chinese.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.06,0:20:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think that people\Nin China ever just feel\Nlike American?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.44,0:20:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, and they go out\Nand get little takeout boxes
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.65,0:20:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,with mashed potatoes\Nand meat loaf
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.53,0:21:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and try and figure out\Nhow to use the little knives and forks?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.45,0:21:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if that ever happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.16,0:21:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, l'll let you go.\NSo call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.79,0:21:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,[PHONE BEEPS]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.00,0:21:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Skyler didn't pick up?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.09,0:21:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Obviously,\Nshe' s not home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.43,0:21:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,HANK:\NBaby. Baby, wait up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.93,0:21:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what was\Nthat about, uh--?\NAbout Chinese?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.44,0:21:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Dinner tonight.\NThat new place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.60,0:21:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How late they serve?\NI don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.61,0:21:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You got Dave at 8.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.07,0:21:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Not tonight.\NYeah, yeah. You do. Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.95,0:21:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's Thursday.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.74,0:21:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.91,0:21:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, l'm pretty sure\Nthat's Thursday.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.41,0:21:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember how at\Nthe last minute they\Nchanged it around for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.96,0:21:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,They were gonna charge us\Na penalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.75,0:21:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, baby,\Nyou only got six more sessions.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.05,0:21:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And l'm doing them, Hank.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.38,0:22:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I would do them,\Nand l'm doing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.51,0:22:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't help it if you got\Nyour days of the week wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.93,0:22:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,BOY:\NLook out. Sorry, Mr. Schrader.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.57,0:22:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's--\NYou know, it' s just--
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.94,0:22:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy. I--
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.82,0:22:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Dave is, um,\Nreally helping you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.04,0:22:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.66,0:22:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,[SOFT lNSTRUMENTAL MUSIC\NPLAYlNG ON CAR STEREO]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.67,0:22:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.97,0:22:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.69,0:22:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,She' s, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.36,0:23:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN:\NHey! Hey, where's my\Nphone call? Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.54,0:23:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hits two in the sand,\Ntwo in the forest. Ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.66,0:23:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And then he says, "Give me a four."\NHANK: Gomez.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.42,0:23:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Gomez?\NWhat do you got for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.17,0:23:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. Chop-chop.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.38,0:23:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning to you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.34,0:23:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,GOMEZ:\NA.P.D. sent this over. This was\Nabout eight or 1 0 days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.89,0:23:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You know Southwest Aniline, right?\NYeah, off the 25?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.02,0:23:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The place smells like feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.44,0:23:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,This is them.\NCheck this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.90,0:23:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy shit. What was that?\NThermite. So they tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.78,0:23:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Burns about 5000 degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.74,0:23:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,GOMEZ:\NKind of stuff you see\Non a James Bond movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.95,0:23:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice.\NGuys who know their trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.91,0:23:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, wait. I take that back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.08,0:23:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHUCKLES]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.42,0:24:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What, they didn't think\Nabout stealing a hand truck?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.09,0:24:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, try rolling it, morons.\NIt's a barrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.05,0:24:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It rolls. Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.09,0:24:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,[BOTH LAUGHING]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.43,0:24:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,HANK: So, what' d they get?\NMethylamine, 30 gallons.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.43,0:24:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,P2P?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.60,0:24:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They' re cooking\Nold school biker meth.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.11,0:24:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell\Nstill does that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.61,0:24:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,All the old-timers I know\Nare either dead or in prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.44,0:24:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Pseudo's in short supply,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.32,0:24:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,so these two make do\Nby changing up the formula.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.12,0:24:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That and the thermite,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.87,0:24:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say these two\Nknow their chemistry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.25,0:24:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But ranking them as burglars?\NShit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.12,0:24:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't trust these two\Nto break into the\NSpecial Olympics.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.17,0:24:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They got book learning\Nbut no street skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.63,0:24:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe they' re college kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.22,0:24:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Chem students\Ntrying to make a big score.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.30,0:24:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.68,0:24:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I tell you, 30 gallons of precursor...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.47,0:24:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That big a score, they're gonna\Nwind up stepping on some toes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.06,0:25:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell you what, they better pray\Nit' s us who catches up to them
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.48,0:25:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,and not those boys from Juarez.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.77,0:25:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHUCKLES]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.10,0:25:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,[CAR ENGINE STARTlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.35,0:26:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,[GASPS]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.82,0:26:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Your daughter wants out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.59,0:26:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,[PHONE RINGING]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.35,0:27:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,SKYLER [ON RECORDING]:\NHey, there. You' ve reached Walt,\NSkyler and Walter, Jr.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.60,0:27:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't come to the phone\Nright now, so please leave us\Na message.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.40,0:27:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,[ANSWERlNG MACHINE BEEPS]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.61,0:27:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,MARIE:\NHey, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.90,0:27:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought l'd try you earlier this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.61,0:27:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,before you go out\Nand, you know, face the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.45,0:27:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm realizing now
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.91,0:27:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,it probably takes you a little longer\Nto get to the phone,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.12,0:27:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,owing to the extra baby weight--
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.46,0:27:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.30,0:27:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,[SIGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.84,0:27:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt, did you spend\Nthe entire night out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.64,0:27:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.64,0:27:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no. Well, not all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.81,0:27:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. I did have a touch of--\NMy stomach, you know. And, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.86,0:27:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew I was gonna be up and down,\Nso l just didn't wanna wake you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.51,0:28:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT:\NHow would he know where I live?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.93,0:28:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure it was Tuco?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.56,0:28:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Who else could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.85,0:28:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you ever tell him my name?\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.10,0:28:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you ever tell him\Nwhere I live or anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.27,0:28:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No.\NWhat about Gonzo, or the dead one?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.36,0:28:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you tell them anything?\NI didn't say jack, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.74,0:28:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Tuco must've put out,\Nlike, you know, feelers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.49,0:28:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got his ways and means, yo.\NSources, all right? He' s closing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.16,0:28:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And what happens when\Nhe finds out that my\Nbrother-in-law is a DEA agent?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.29,0:28:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God.\NWhat happens then?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.43,0:29:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's got five bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.85,0:29:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally figured out how to--\NLook, l just finally-- l figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.48,0:29:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I say we get a second gun, right?\NFor you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.27,0:29:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, don' t we, like,\Ndouble our chances?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.40,0:29:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, mathematically.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.32,0:29:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a better idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.53,0:29:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.91,0:29:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.45,0:29:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Mr. White?\NLay it on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.12,0:29:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Beans.\NBeans?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.88,0:29:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They' re castor beans.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.92,0:29:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what are we gonna do\Nwith them?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.72,0:29:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we just gonna grow\Na magic beanstalk? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.43,0:29:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Climb it and escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.26,0:29:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We are going to process them\Ninto ricin.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.06,0:29:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Rice and beans?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.77,0:29:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ricin.\NIt's an extremely effective poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.27,0:29:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's toxic in small doses.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.44,0:30:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Also fairly easy to overlook\Nduring an autopsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.78,0:30:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.12,0:30:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. So--\NDon't touch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.08,0:30:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You can get poisoned from beans?\NYes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.41,0:30:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Back in the late 70s,\Nricin was used to assassinate\Na Bulgarian journalist.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.63,0:30:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The KGB modified\Nthe tip of an umbrella
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.96,0:30:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,to inject a tiny pellet\Ninto the man's leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.26,0:30:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And we' re talking about\Nan amount not much\Nbigger than the head of a pin.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.85,0:30:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But it-- lt killed him?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.47,0:30:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.39,0:30:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we just need to figure out\Na delivery device,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.31,0:30:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,and then no more Tuco.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.50,0:30:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.14,0:31:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[KNOCKlNG ON WINDOW]
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.53,0:31:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sky.\NHey, Hank.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.28,0:31:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.32,0:31:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this, uh--?\NThis a bad time?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.70,0:31:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Um-- No, come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.04,0:31:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.38,0:31:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I should've called first.\NI'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.59,0:31:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What can I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.43,0:31:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe, um, we ought--
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.02,0:31:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna sit down first?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.65,0:31:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, Hank.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.86,0:32:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Depends on whether or not\Nthis is gonna be about Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.57,0:32:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Did she send you?\NHell, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.58,0:32:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,She' s barely\Neven talking to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.33,0:32:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.37,0:32:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Self-preservation.\NBig time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.25,0:32:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,[LAUGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.75,0:32:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.96,0:32:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you gals have\Nyour ups and downs.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.38,0:32:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it.\NGals.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.05,0:32:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And l need to get involved\Nlike l need a second\Nhole in my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.60,0:32:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,[LAUGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.89,0:32:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you could do me\Nthis huge favor and just\Nreturn her phone calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.14,0:32:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't, ahem, think\NI'm quite ready to do that yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.77,0:32:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Communication.\NCommunication, right?\NBack and forth. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.82,0:32:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sky, do this for me, please.\NYou can yell at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.45,0:32:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Just call her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.08,0:32:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,[SIGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.66,0:33:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Marie is a shoplifter, Hank.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.63,0:33:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.96,0:33:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That baby tiara\Nshe gave me at the shower?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.34,0:33:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,She stole it\Nfrom Gertrude Zachary's. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.80,0:33:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost got arrested\Nwhen l went back to return it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.35,0:33:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And Marie won't admit it.\NShe won't apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.90,0:33:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.11,0:33:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If l thought you were gonna\Nreturn it, l would have never,\Nyou know...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.74,0:33:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You knew about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.99,0:33:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We' re working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.66,0:33:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean,\Nshe' s got this therapist, Dave.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.00,0:33:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And l mean, Dave is really good.\NDave's good, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.09,0:33:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's an ongoing process, Sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.92,0:33:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,and we have gotta be\Nunderstanding, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.80,0:33:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, we gotta, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.47,0:33:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta support the shit out of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.35,0:33:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.18,0:34:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.35,0:34:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.40,0:34:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I need support.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.32,0:34:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.11,0:34:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The almost-40-year-old\Npregnant woman
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.36,0:34:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,with the surprise baby\Non the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.78,0:34:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And the husband\Nwith the lung cancer
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.70,0:34:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,who disappears for hours on end,\Nand l don' t know where he goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.70,0:34:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And he barely\Neven speaks to me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.21,0:34:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,With the moody son\Nwho does the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.04,0:34:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And the overdrawn\Nchecking account.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.00,0:34:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And the lukewarm water heater\Nthat leaks rusty-looking crap
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.76,0:34:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,and is rotting out the floor\Nof the utility closet
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.72,0:34:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,and we can't even afford to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.01,0:34:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But, oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.22,0:34:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I' m supposed to go,\N"Hank, please,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.02,0:34:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,what can l possibly do\Nto further benefit
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.73,0:34:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,my spoiled, kleptomaniac,\Nbitch sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.69,0:34:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,who somehow always manages\Nto be the center of attention?"
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.82,0:34:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Because God knows she' s the one\Nwith the really important problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.12,0:35:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,[SOBBING]
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.34,0:35:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Want me to take a look\Nat that utility closet?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.55,0:35:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.62,0:35:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,JESSE:\NThat's all it takes?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.79,0:35:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT:\NThat's all it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.13,0:35:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,JESSE:\NSo now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.55,0:35:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT:\NNow we arrange\Nour next meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.43,0:36:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,In a public place this time.\NNice and safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.97,0:36:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Business as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.23,0:36:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And after we sell him\Nour usual four pounds,\Nthen we'll pull this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.52,0:36:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,"By the way, Tuco,\Nthis is a new meth formula\Nwe've been working on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.78,0:36:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Care to try it?"
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.99,0:36:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, well, what's new about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.99,0:36:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, just in case he asks.\NWhat do we say?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.33,0:36:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.\NWhatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.66,0:36:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It gets the user\Ninsanely high.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.83,0:36:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean,\Nhow much salesmanship\Ndo we really need?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.42,0:36:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That degenerate\Nsnorts anything\Nhe gets his hands on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.09,0:36:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, well, we'll just put\Na pin in that, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.22,0:36:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, within the next\N48 hours, maybe 72,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.85,0:36:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,it' ll look like natural causes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.68,0:36:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What, like a heart attack?\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.90,0:36:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Or the flu, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.02,0:36:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,His associates won' t know\Nany differently,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.61,0:36:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,and we'll be in the clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.20,0:37:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Not if Tuco kills us first.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.37,0:37:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,[PHONE RINGING]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.04,0:37:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.80,0:37:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,[PHONE CONTINUES RINGING]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.47,0:37:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.72,0:37:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hank. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.06,0:37:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,HANK:\NOh, hey, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.60,0:37:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You been home yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.15,0:37:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,No. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.69,0:37:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.23,0:37:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I really screwed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.82,0:37:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I apologize in advance for the earful\Nyou're gonna hear from Skyler.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.11,0:37:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I was trying to get her and Marie\Ntalking again. Big mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.08,0:37:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have just kept out of it.\NYeah, well, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.54,0:37:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Me and my big mouth, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.33,0:37:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, that--\NYou know, it happens.\NIt's no problem. No worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.25,0:37:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, thanks, man.\NI appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.42,0:38:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesus, the wives, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.13,0:38:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hank, unfortunately, l really--
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.72,0:38:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.\NHey, man, don' t let me keep you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.43,0:38:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I' m at work, so--\NOh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.60,0:38:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[LAUGHING]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.48,0:38:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna see something\Nreally freaky?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.40,0:38:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, l would, but--\NSeriously, Walt, this is--
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.90,0:38:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,[LAUGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.11,0:38:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta check out this crime scene\Nme and Gomie are at. Just a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.49,0:38:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,[CAMERA CLlCKS]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.99,0:38:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,[LAUGHING]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.41,0:38:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hank.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.62,0:38:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on. lt should be\Ncoming through right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.96,0:38:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,[PHONE BEEPS]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.29,0:38:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess it could be worse, huh?\NCould be having a day like these two.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.84,0:38:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Couple of local bulletheads.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.13,0:38:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess they pissed off\Nthe wrong guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.72,0:38:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt, you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.14,0:38:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Walt?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.69,0:39:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking this.\NNo. It's my gun. I need it!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.57,0:39:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you don't.\NNot if you leave town.\NGet out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.36,0:39:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Tuco killing Gonzo means\Nhe's coming after us next.\NNow, I' ve--
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.70,0:39:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I've gotta get home. My family.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.71,0:39:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.64,0:39:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,[TlRES SCREECHING]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.12,0:39:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,[COUGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.37,0:39:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Skyler?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.13,0:40:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT:\NWalter, Jr.?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.72,0:40:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Skyler?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.89,0:40:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,[CLANKING]
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.06,0:40:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,[COUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.81,0:40:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT:\NHey.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.10,0:41:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Walter, Jr.?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.94,0:41:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Having dinner at Louis' house.\NSupposedly.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.74,0:41:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep. All day, I' ve had\Nthe whole house to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.62,0:41:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So where have you been\Nthis time?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.71,0:41:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,SKYLER:\NWalt?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.15,0:41:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.33,0:42:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt, will you come in here\Nand talk to me please?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.84,0:42:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.97,0:42:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.48,0:42:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,HANK:\NYeah, l recognize\Nthese two knobjobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.86,0:42:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Known associates\Nof a psychotic piece of shit
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.53,0:42:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,named Tuco Salamanca.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.95,0:42:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess he got tired of associating.\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.70,0:42:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you mind if I get in there?\NNo, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.54,0:42:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.25,0:42:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The big one smells fresher.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.42,0:42:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys find a death wound?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.67,0:42:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.88,0:42:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I see lots of blood,\Nbut no bullet holes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.97,0:43:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,DETECTlVE:\NYeah. You done taking\Npictures?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.69,0:43:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Let's lay them out flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.27,0:43:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,HANK:\NLet me get out of your\Nway here, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.33,0:43:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,[CRUNCH]
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.08,0:43:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, snap.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.62,0:43:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, Ricky.\NLeave something for the coroner.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.30,0:43:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.51,0:43:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, someone call Jay Leno.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.72,0:43:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We got the world's\Ndumbest criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.64,0:43:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy wasn' t murdered.\NLook.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.27,0:43:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Big stuff here\Nwas moving this guy' s body
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.44,0:43:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,when the stack\Nmust have shifted.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.99,0:43:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Crushed his arm,\Npinned him here,\Nand he, uh, bled out.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.61,0:44:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Poetic justice. Oh, I love it.\NDon't you just?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.45,0:44:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Get a photo of me\Nwith this guy, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.75,0:44:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Old stumpy, here. Make sure\Nyou get the stump in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.55,0:44:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt, would you\Ntalk to me, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.06,0:44:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I-- l don't know where to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.61,0:44:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,[PHONE RINGING]
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.03,0:45:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell\Nare you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.88,0:45:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.10,0:45:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,TUCO:\NGet in.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.07,0:46:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,TUCO:\NLet's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.69,0:46:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
